  "intro": {
    "text": "Add `-(y)AcAk` and the endings of the present to the stem: *yap-* → *yapacağım* (I will do), *gel-* → *geleceksin* (you will come). After a vowel comes a buffer y: *okuyacak*. Before a vowel ending, k softens to ğ: *yapacağım*, *geleceğiz*.",
    "see": "gp-future"
  },
